keymasq (0.9.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add scroll wheel remapping support.
  * Add scroll wheel combo support.
  * Improve macro recording and saving flows.
  * Move superkey mappings into a dedicated selector tab for clearer editing.
  * Add Unicode support for type macros.

